Dataset: Cyclic peptides binding to protein targets
Authors: Kadochnikova Margarita
Repository: https://github.com/chem-data-extraction/Cyclic_peptides_binding_to_protein_targets

Source data:
- Patel et al. (2020) PNAS — DOI: 10.1073/pnas.2003086117
- Wang et al. (2019) Angewandte — DOI: 10.1002/ange.201908713
- Charitou et al. (2022) JCTC — DOI: 10.1021/acs.jctc.2c00075
- RCSB Protein Data Bank — https://www.rcsb.org/
